INSERT INTO `property` VALUES (84,15,3200.00,20,'Active',1,'Roch House','This comfortable student accommodation is located within walking distance of NMU, making it convenient for students who want to save time and transport costs. The property offers a secure and peaceful environment with controlled access and well-maintained shared spaces. Students are close to the Boardwalk Mall, where they can find shops, restaurants, entertainment and everyday essentials. The beach is also nearby, providing a great place to relax, exercise or spend time with friends after classes.',3200.00,'Nelson Mandela University residences, Summerstrand, Gqeberha, 6001','Gqeberha','On Campus','Single Room','2026-01-01',0.00,0,'2026-09-01 08:54:06','2026-10-15 23:37:12',NULL,NULL,'Walking distance','NSFAS','Mixed',NULL,NULL,NULL),(85,15,3400.00,22,'Active',1,'Summerstrand Student Village','This modern accommodation offers students a comfortable place to live close to campus and many of Summerstrand\'s popular attractions. NMU is within walking distance, making daily travel to lectures simple and convenient. The property provides a secure living environment and is located near shops, restaurants, and other essential services. Students can also easily reach Boardwalk Mall and the beach, making it easy to enjoy the coastal lifestyle while staying close to university.',3400.00,'6 Marine Dr, Summerstrand, Gqeberha, 6001, South Africa','Gqeberha','On Campus','Single Room','2026-01-01',0.00,0,'2026-09-01 08:54:06','2026-10-15 23:37:12',NULL,NULL,'Walking distance','Any','Mixed',NULL,NULL,NULL),(86,15,3300.00,25,'Active',1,'Sanlam Student Village','This comfortable student accommodation is located within walking distance of both North and South Campus, making it convenient for students who want to save time and transport costs. The property offers a secure and peaceful environment with controlled access and well-maintained shared spaces. Students are close to the Boardwalk Mall, where they can find 