'Male only',NULL,NULL,NULL),(89,15,4200.00,15,'Active',1,'15 Admiralty','This well-located student property offers convenient accommodation close to all campuses, making it an excellent choice for students who prefer walking to campus. The property is situated in a secure and peaceful neighborhood with easy access to shops, restaurants, and other essential services. Boardwalk Mall is close by for entertainment, dining and shopping, while the nearby beach offers opportunities for relaxation and outdoor activities. With campus, amenities, and leisure activities all within easy reach, students can enjoy a convenient and balanced lifestyle.',4200.00,'15 Admiralty','Gqeberha','Summerstrand','Single Room','2027-01-01',0.00,0,'2026-09-01 08:54:06','2026-10-15 20:55:27',NULL,NULL,'Walking distance','NSFAS','Seniors only',NULL,NULL,NULL),(90,15,4000.00,22,'Active',1,'Ivana Drive','This well-located student property offers convenient accommodation close to NMU, making it an excellent choice for students who prefer walking to campus. The property is situated in a secure and peaceful neighborhood with easy access to shops, restaurants and other essential services. Boardwalk Mall is close by for entertainment, dining and shopping, while the nearby beach offers opportunities for relaxation and outdoor activities. With campus, amenities and leisure activities all within easy reach, students can enjoy a convenient and balanced lifestyle.',4000.00,'2 Ivana St, Summerstrand, Gqeberha, 6001','Summerstrand','Summerstrand','Sharing','2027-01-01',0.00,0,'2026-09-01 08:54:06','2026-10-15 20:55:27',NULL,NULL,'Shuttle required','Bursary','Mixed',NULL,NULL,NULL),(91,15,3800.00,4,'Active',1,'16 Cardiff','Enjoy convenient student living in the heart of Summerstrand, with Second Avenue Campus just a short walk away. The property is situated in a safe and student-friendly neighbourhood with easy access to local shops, restaurants and public transport. Boardwalk Mall is nearby for shopping, dinin