s located in a convenient and peaceful part of town, giving students easy access to a wide range of shops and everyday services. Although the property is further from campus, students can make use of shuttle services for reliable transport to NMU. Several parks nearby provide open spaces for relaxing, walking or exercising, while shopping centres and local stores make it easy to get groceries, clothing and other essentials. The property offers a comfortable and practical environment for student living.',3000.00,'30 Govan Mbeki St, Gqeberha Central, Gqeberha, 6001','Town','Town','Single Room','2027-01-01',0.00,0,'2026-09-01 08:54:06','2026-10-15 20:55:27',NULL,NULL,'Shuttle required','Any','Mixed',NULL,NULL,NULL),(100,15,3200.00,22,'Active',1,'Gen Z','Located in town, this accommodation provides students with convenient access to shops, restaurants and essential services. A shuttle service makes travelling to NMU easier, allowing students to focus on their studies without worrying about daily transport. The surrounding area has several parks and open spaces where students can relax or spend time with friends. With numerous shopping stores and amenities nearby, students have everything they need within easy reach.',3200.00,'30 Govan Mbeki St, Gqeberha Central, Gqeberha, 6001','Town','Town','Sharing','2025-01-01',0.00,0,'2026-09-01 08:54:06','2026-10-15 20:55:27',NULL,NULL,'Shuttle required','Any','Mixed',NULL,NULL,NULL),(101,15,3100.00,25,'Active',1,'The Regent','This property offers students a comfortable place to live in a quieter part of town, away from the busy campus environment. Students can use the available shuttle service to travel to NMU, while the surrounding area provides plenty of convenient amenities. Nearby parks offer space for outdoor activities and relaxation, and a variety of shopping stores, restaurants and services are available close to the property. It is a practical option for students looking for convenience and a peaceful home environment.',3