nd, you can focus on your studies while feeling at home. It’s a great place to connect with fellow students, build friendships, and enjoy your student life!',NULL,'16 Cardiff Street, Gqeberha, Nelson Mandela Bay, 6001','Gqeberha','Summerstrand','Sharing','2027-01-01',0.00,0,NULL,'2026-10-15 20:55:27',NULL,NULL,'Shuttle required','Self-Paying','Female only','Dear Landlord,\r\n\r\nThank you for submitting your property for consideration. Unfortunately, we are unable to approve it for student accommodation because the proposed rental amount of **R20,000 per month** is too high for our target student market. We aim to provide affordable accommodation that students can realistically afford, and this price exceeds our budget requirements.\r\n\r\nWe appreciate your interest and thank you for your time and understanding.\r\n\r\nKind regards,  \r\nAccommodation Management Team',NULL,NULL),(132,27,4500.00,6,'Active',1,'Sunset','Experience a welcoming, student-friendly environment where comfort and peace of mind come first. Enjoy a pleasant space to rest, study, and recharge after a busy day on campus. With a focus on student needs, a peaceful atmosphere, and a sense of community, you can feel at home while working towards your academic goals',1000.00,'17 Cardiff Street, Gqeberha, Nelson Mandela Bay, 6001','Gqeberha','Central','Single Room','2026-10-15',0.00,0,NULL,'2026-10-15 20:55:27',NULL,NULL,'Shuttle required','NSFAS','Male only',NULL,NULL,NULL);
